    "Scan of the 1968 edition of the Ivor, Virginia, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1968; photo inspected in 1989; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1992.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.1 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
